.SH BUGS
A property that crashes or never returns is not shrunk.
The shrinker can stop at a case that no one change makes simpler, though a smaller one exists.
Only
.IR expand 's
spans take part in the change to a span inside; those of
.I span
and
.I more
do not.
APE has no
.IR prop.h .
